sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Src as Ingest source
    participant API as security-log-search ingest API
    participant K as Kafka (events.normalized / alerts.fired)
    participant Flink as Flink correlation job
    participant Hub as notification-hub (consumer)
    participant Op as Operator

    Src->>API: POST /api/v1/events (raw)
    API->>K: publish events.normalized
    K-->>Flink: source
    Flink->>Flink: Sigma-derived rule + threshold eval (KeyedProcessFunction + MapState)
    Flink->>K: publish alerts.fired
    par this repo consumer
        K-->>API: INSERT alerts row + audit_entries
    and external consumer
        K-->>Hub: alerts.fired consume
        Hub->>Op: per-channel fan-out (email / Slack / SMS)
        Hub->>K: notification.delivered (result)
        K-->>API: re-ingested for audit
    end
